      "value": "@{632a1f5ab98aa644af84dab3|full_name}: easy fix: remove the count for members displaying on world images add a world icon under the world itself instead of player icon when viewing the world itself like the icon can display how many worlds are viewable as public spaces because players dont really need to be looking at private spaces when trying to search for public spaces hence why there private in the first place.\n\nwhen viewing the instances that are open it should display the player count in real time filter each instance name up and down every 10 seconds hence to allow the player to choose the instance they want to join before the instance updates.\n\nand then group instances should have there name displayed instead of the instance saying its a group instance. on the right.",
